         "_comment_shrink_owner_1024": "Owner 24 Oct: Just shrink it (exception to the never-shrink rule for this naturalistic pilot only). At 3.85 m the pilot is 6.84 m nose to tail and combat admission could not seat it in the Warrens mouth (6.0 m ring) or the Hall elite room (7.0 m) with the 0.6 m clearance, so the elite fight never formed. Uniform scale 3.85 -> 3.20 m (x0.8312): radius, seat and dismount distance scaled by the same ratio; still well above the 1.80 m trainer. Terrapup has no evolution line, so no ladder order changes.",
