         "_comment_model_nat1022": "F36#0 owner style direction 22 Oct: naturalistic pilot (coordinator Meshy, candidate_nat1022; measured quadruped rig, own clips; provenance in candidate_nat1022/source/meshy_provenance.jsonl, drafted reference reference/nat1022-concept.png). Close-1024 b1 (CPU, three judges, confirming batch): mapped 7.62 vs live 5.30 (CPU-provisional). Field rim 0.25, no albedo lift (it blew out the plates).",
